{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "三角形内角和为什么是 180 度",
    "goals": [
      "理解平角是 180 度的几何直观",
      "通过过顶点作平行线，掌握内错角相等将三个内角拼成平角的证明过程"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "遵照学生的学习偏好，开门见山先给结论，再逐步拆解为什么",
        "使用折叠与拼角的直观比喻，结合平行线与内错角的逻辑推导"
      ]
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "给出结论并利用过顶点的平行线和内错角关系证明内角和为180度",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "按你喜欢的习惯，我们先直接看结论：在平面上，任意三角形的三个内角加起来，一定正好等于 180 度！",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "opening-title",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "三角形内角和为什么是 180 度",
                "items": [
                  "本课导入"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "\\angle A + \\angle B + \\angle C = 180^\\circ"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "为什么一定会是 180 度呢？我们可以把这三个角想成三个拼图碎片。要证明它们加起来是 180 度，最漂亮的方法就是把它们严丝合缝地拼成一条平角直线。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "证明思路：拼成平角",
                "items": [
                  "一条直线的平角是 180°",
                  "利用平行线把角搬到同一个顶点"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "来看具体的推导步骤：我们在三角形 ABC 的顶点 A 处，作一条平行于底边 BC 的辅助线直线 l。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "diagram",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "过程图",
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "as": "step-01",
                    "label": "步骤 1：画三角形 ABC，过顶点 A 作直线 l 平行于 BC"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "step-02",
                    "label": "步骤 2：由两直线平行内错角相等，得出角1 = 角B，角2 = 角C"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "step-03",
                    "label": "步骤 3：直线 l 上的角1 + 角A + 角2 构成平角 180°"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "step-04",
                    "label": "结论：角A + 角B + 角C = 180°"
                  }
                ],
                "edges": [
                  {
                    "as": "edge-01",
                    "from": "step-01",
                    "to": "step-02",
                    "label": "下一步"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "edge-02",
                    "from": "step-02",
                    "to": "step-03",
                    "label": "下一步"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "edge-03",
                    "from": "step-03",
                    "to": "step-04",
                    "label": "下一步"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "因为这两条线是平行的，根据两直线平行内错角相等，底部的角 B 就等于辅助线上方左侧的角 1，角 C 就等于右侧的角 2！",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-04-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "\\angle 1 = \\angle B,\\quad \\angle 2 = \\angle C"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-03-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-05",
          "say": "看顶点 A 处：角 1、原有的角 A 和角 2 刚好铺满整条直线 l，形成了一个平角 180 度。把它们替换回来，也就是角 A 加角 B 加角 C 等于 180 度！无论三角形怎么变形，这个平行线的几何关系永远成立。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-05-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "\\angle 1 + \\angle A + \\angle 2 = 180^\\circ \\implies \\angle B + \\angle A + \\angle C = 180^\\circ"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-04-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "任意三角形的三个内角，都能通过作底边的平行线转化为一条直线上的三个相邻角，拼成平角 180°。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-03-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
